# Transmute Artifact finds Blightsteel Colossus by sacrificing a Mox Sapphire: the Colossus costs twelve more than the
# Mox, so Bot1 "may pay {X}, where X is the difference" before the card goes anywhere. The question is about a card
# that is still in the library the search found it in, and the search is over, so nobody is looking at that library
# any more.
#
# Handed over at that payment rather than answered, so a session can be dealt it: a served game used to stop here
# with "Seat 1 was prompted about ... (Blightsteel Colossus, a Card in player:1.Library owned by seat 1), which is not
# in their view". See ScriptedPositionsThroughTransportTests.
#
# Turn 1: the Island and the Mox pay {U}{U}, and the tapped Mox is the artifact sacrificed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Transmute Artifact
Island x4
Island x3
Blightsteel Colossus
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Transmute Artifact.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Search(Blightsteel Colossus)
[Handover Bot1.Decline]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Step = Main1
Stack = Transmute Artifact
Bot1.Battlefield = Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Library = Island; Island; Island; Blightsteel Colossus; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
